# Environment variables for Good Secrets Safaris
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development (.env.local is
# gitignored and never committed). Vite only exposes variables prefixed
# with VITE_ to client-side code - never put secrets that must stay
# server-side behind that prefix.

# Public site URL, used for canonical links, sitemap generation, and
# absolute Open Graph image URLs.
VITE_SITE_URL="https://www.goodsecretssafaris.com"

# --- Planned, not yet wired up (see README "Known gaps") ---
# Once enquiry forms and admin authentication are backed by a real
# service, their configuration will live here. Do not hardcode API
# keys, form endpoints, or credentials directly in source files.

# Temporary admin gate ONLY - see src/routes/AdminRoute.tsx for why this
# is not real security. Set this in .env.local (never commit a real
# value); leaving it unset blocks admin access entirely.
VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=""
